#passage(("They're the opposite of one another, essentially. So Haram would mean forbidden, something which is not allowed Islamically, something which is immoral, not accepted, not allowed, etc. And Halal would be something allowed, acceptable, you're allowed to do, it's permissible for you to do.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Mormon Debates Muslim On The Validity Of His Faith! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0dXtlG11q-g", ((44, "0:44–0:54"),))
