#passage(("There's so many experiences of people who came from the UK, America, and they vlogged themselves entering people's homes, because they're unlocked: they going to meet someone, they going to the wrong house, entering inside the house. And the cars are open: you open the door, the car is already open. They were shocked, because they can't do this in the West. And no one could come and say, okay, this is these countries. No, it is the fact that they're applying Islamic laws in certain aspect. They're not perfect, nobody is perfect, no country is perfect, applying everything, but you see the outcomes of applying certain aspects of God laws. If you fully apply it, you see the benefit for the society, the community as a whole. That's why it's very important for us to do our work, our job, to explain further the teachings of Islam, the rules of the [Sharia].",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Eddie @TheDeenShowTV Interviews The Muslim Lantern | Masjid Dar Al-Qur'an | Chicago - USA”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sLfJyJGj_eg", ((3300, "55:00–55:54"),))
