#passage(("It also can be applied when we see these cases and scenarios today, where people are literally doing it in the streets. Go to places like in the \"advanced West\", where they sell women like pigs in these red rooms, glass rooms, where you can purchase a \"woman\" for X amount of price! This is the liberal West! Islam has these rules because people can go to that extreme. And then when you go to the extreme, then be prepared! That will never happen in an Islamic society. These gross kind of behaviors that are destructive to the entire community and society will not happen in Islamic society, because Islamic society deters.", "So first, the punishment can be applied, and it has been applied upon people who come, who want to purify themselves. So if I did this, and I don't want to be punished in the Afterlife: this life's punishment, no matter what, is easier than the punishment of the Afterlife. So if I want to repent, I will come and I will confess the crime, and then I'll be punished. And then on the Day of Judgment, I am certain; that's the promise: if you've been punished in this Life, you're not going to be punished in the Afterlife. So then, I feel safe in my heart: I'm not going to be punished in the Afterlife because of this sin that I did.", "When I told you these details, you didn't know them. So, if you didn't know them, when you read this verse, it deters you, because you're worried, \"If I do this, this will happen to me.\" You assumed that everybody understands every specific criteria to do with the punishment. No, they don't! And therefore, it will be a deterrent for many people from committing this specific sin. That's why, Allah says, do the punishment in public. Let people see it! So let people be deterred from the punishment when that punishment is done, so others will not go and do it.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Lady Questions Muslim On Outdated Laws In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TGTUzypPFHI", ((1282,