#passage(("There is a punishment for Apostasy in Islam, as there is a punishment for Apostasy in Judaism, and Christianity, and other Faiths, and as there a punishment for treason in atheism, which is a capital death according to these countries. So leaving Islam is treason by definition. It's doing treason to your own Faith and community. So in Islam, there is a capital punishment, yes. But there are so many conditions. People tell you the thing, but they don't tell you how Islam applies the thing. When I start telling you details, you realise how these people are lying to you. They're deceiving you, trying to take you away from your Faith. They couldn't care less about us or our women. They just want you to leave Islam, as Allah says in the Quran (alBaqara2:120) وَلَن تَرۡضَىٰ عَنكَ ٱلۡیَهُودُ وَلَا ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ حَتَّىٰ تَتَّبِعَ مِلَّتَهُمۡ (The Jews and Christians will never be pleased with you until you follow their Religion). That's all they want. They want you to leave your Faith and become like them.", "So, about the Apostasy, there are conditions. The first condition is that it has to be a Sharia State. Today, so many people leave Islam, nobody does anything to them, because there is no Sharia State today that applies the Islamic rules 100%. People be leaving Islam and nothing happens to them. Nobody can go and be a vigilante and go do something to someone. It's not allowed in Islam. You will be punished if you take things into your own hand.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Emotional Apostate Reveals Her True Colours After Getting Exposed! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NTgbl-R9v_0", ((1387, "23:07–24:02"), (1445, "24:05–24:37"),))
