ous and just. And then the next verse: Allah forbids us from being righteous and just towards who? (Towards those who fight us and kick us out of our homes.)", "So when someone says that Gen0cide is built within Islamic system, we know obviously that's not true. But I understand why he would say that. A lot of people in America think like this. A lot of people in America have this in their surroundings and they just reflect the information they've heard, but they haven't really investigated what they're saying.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Asmongold Wants To Read The Quran?! Chunkz Will Disown His Kids If They Leave Islam?!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y2zJLeRXXXk", ((11, "0:11–1:55"), (123, "2:03–3:10"), (195, "3:15–3:31"),))
