.", "That's why the Jewish people, for example, who were running away from Christians, from the Crusades, they went to Morocco and they begged: \"Please, let us pay the Jizya\", because they know the Jizya is a very small amount of money that only military-aged combatants will pay, \"and take us in and protect us from those Crusaders who want to chop our heads off!\" So this Jizya is the most merciful command that you can find in an Islamic state.", "On the other hand, when Christians went into a land, what they did is they plundered the land, took everything in the land, as is mentioned in Deuteronomy20:10. The Bible explicitly mentions and teaches: if you go and you conquer a city or take over a city or siege a city and take it, you take all of the goods in it for yourself. Now, if you want to talk about that and what happens in war, I think you should start with your book and what your book teaches that you need to do to people, before we talk about the Jizya.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Confident Christian Attempts To Educate A Muslim On Islamic History! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XzZHWEENo6k", ((712, "11:52–12:47"), (771, "12:51–13:34"), (828, "13:48–14:15"), (859, "14:19–14:44"), (887, "14:47–15:18"),))
