#passage(("Gambling: how Islam prohibits these things, in which the liberal, advanced, enlightened, great society does not prohibit. And Islam, \"the backward\", \"outdated\", all of these terms that they would use, is telling you. But look at the effects in these societies in which they're calling to be advanced: how it's in complete destruction and chaos. In gambling, it's so evil of a thing that you're winning what someone else has [lost]. The only way you can make money is by your brother losing money, because the casino doesn't lose money. Using your money against your money: this is how the casino is making money. It's so evil of a thing that even winning, when you're happy, when you're winning, someone has lost. As a community and a society. And that's why Islam prohibits these things.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Islam Unveiled: Compelling Evidence For The Truthfulness Of Islam | Chicago - USA | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AUFsBco_CF0", ((3453, "57:33–58:28"),))
// U ML283:174-187 | The Muslim Lantern | 1
#passage(("This idea of gambling: you got many Muslims trying to imitate the non-Muslims. They're trying to imitate people like this brother in humanity, trying to imitate people who are not Muslims in getting fame, becoming famous and acting like they do in their videos. You got Muslims now jumping into the same hoop, making this content and saying \"I'm a Muslim!\", and they go to clubs and bars and drink alcohol and do all of these things, and then, in their videos, they say \"I'm a Muslim.\" And here and there, they say: MashaAllah (Allah wills it), Alhamdulillah (Praise is due to God), Astaghfirullah (I ask forgiveness from God), as if now they've become a representation of Islam. While you have people like him whom they are trying to imitate, who's not even a Muslim, who is leaving gambling, leaving these things because he realises that these are worldly desires, and you have Muslims sitting in the casinos and the clubs and the bars. So, what is stopping you, as a Muslim, to actually do these things? What is stopping you from leaving these worldly desires and learning and understanding that this is not going to benefit you in your آخرة (Akhira: Afterlife)?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Popular Youtuber Abandons Money And Fame For Christianity?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F3uZK_khCsk", ((851, "14:11–15:09"),))

