#passage(("Especially look at how music are used today. Music is a tool and instrument of Satan. It is used for what? Look at the hit songs. It's about being a gangster. Drinking alcohol, drugs, all of that. Where do you find music? You find it in the club, in the bar, in link with fornication and in link with alcohol. They exist together. Music has to exist with these things.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Unitarian Christian Questions The Similarities Between The Quran & The Bible! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t9EQwV9zMIE", ((1297, "21:37–22:00"),))
