#passage(("Now, when it comes to drawing, it's only drawing living things. It's only drawing living human beings. It's not only just drawing, but it's also mainly the Hadith is used about sculpture, making something. Because humans have a habit of worshipping these things later on. That's how it happened in the beginning, at the time of Noah. People have made these idols of righteous people, and then they started worshipping them. So anything that can lead into a form of worship is strictly prohibited as well, or worshipping other than God, strictly prohibited as well in Islam.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Ziônist Settler Reveals The Truth About Palestinian Occupation! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6sGviqyYXvw", ((694, "11:34–12:01"),))
