#passage(("Free mixing can be allowed in the cases of necessity, not because it's free mixing, but every ruling in cases of necessity is allowed. So in the [dawah], if you're doing Street [dawah], it's a case of necessity that we have to deal with a woman. But right now, if I go and bring a sister, whoever sister who has a social media: \"come sit down here\", and we joke a little bit, back and forth, and maybe talking about sensitive topics to do with Islam: it's clear, the Quran and the [Sunnah] are clear.", "The prophet, he was sitting down, and he didn't stand until the women left, and when he stood up the [Sahabah] stood up. So they let the women go first. You have in the Quran [Musa] and the two girls: \"we don't want a free mix with these people; we're waiting, and these people are done\"; so we don't free [mix] with them. This is something that is well known in Islam. I heard some people saying you have no evidences. There are tons of evidences.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Amazing Collab| The Muslim Lantern & Sheikh Uthman Meet For The First Time| @OneMessageFoundation”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LVdIHlFWDgc", ((3875, "1:04:35–1:05:22"), (3923, "1:05:23–1:06:05"),))
