#passage(("There's many of the things that the God commands, we do them as an act of worship, as submission to him. Now the question is, and this is interesting to think about: can God give you the [foreskin] as a test, whether you will submit to his command not knowing the reason behind doing it or not? He can. Can he create the [foreskin] to fulfill a specific purpose and then command you to remove it? Yes. Circumcision the Prophet does, but not only Islam: it's [Abrahamic] tradition.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Man Grills Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-rSkeAMTyK0", ((977, "16:17–16:59"),))
